       "</style><body><div id=\"sk-container-id-1\" class=\"sk-top-container\"><div class=\"sk-text-repr-fallback\"><pre>Pipeline(steps=[(&#x27;prep&#x27;,\n",
       "                 ColumnTransformer(transformers=[(&#x27;txt&#x27;,\n",
